  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7267201",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Sango",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "726720101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "726720101": {
            "id": "726720101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Ugh, that Wakamurasaki... I shouldn't have let her know about Kageroumaru...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720102"
            ]
          },
          "726720102": {
            "id": "726720102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What's wrong?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720103"
            ]
          },
          "726720103": {
            "id": "726720103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Oh, hello there, Traveler. Do you still remember the Ubiquity Net, by any chance?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720104"
            ]
          },
          "726720104": {
            "id": "726720104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "After we settled the previous incident, I explained all that happened to a friend of mine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720105"
            ]
          },
          "726720105": {
            "id": "726720105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Her name is Wakamurasaki, and she's... Well, she calls herself a \"designer.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720106"
            ]
          },
          "726720106": {
            "id": "726720106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "She was quite inspired by the manner in which you used the net.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720107"
            ]
          },
          "726720107": {
            "id": "726720107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "So she's been badgering me this whole time to help her look up new techniques with which she can continue modifying the Ubiquity Net...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720108"
            ]
          },
          "726720108": {
            "id": "726720108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "I couldn't deal with all that nagging, so I did find her something new in that ancient collection of mine...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720109"
            ]
          },
          "726720109": {
            "id": "726720109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "If the fancy takes you, Traveler, go to her place. If I don't miss my guess, she's probably finished her modifications by now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7267202",
      "subQuestName": "Look for Wakamurasaki",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "726720201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "726720201": {
            "id": "726720201",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "Well, that should certainly do it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720202"
            ]
          },
          "726720202": {
            "id": "726720202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Hello there, are you Wakamurasaki?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720203"
            ]
          },
          "726720203": {
            "id": "726720203",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "That's me! What do you need?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720204"
            ]
          },
          "726720204": {
            "id": "726720204",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Well, I'm here about the Ubiquity Net...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720205"
            ]
          },
          "726720205": {
            "id": "726720205",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "Oh, are you? ...Ohh, I remember now. You must be that Traveler! Sango told me about you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720206"
            ]
          },
          "726720206": {
            "id": "726720206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "The way in which you operated that Net was truly impressive. Inspiring, in fact!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720207"
            ]
          },
          "726720207": {
            "id": "726720207",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I've heard that you've been modifying it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720208"
            ]
          },
          "726720208": {
            "id": "726720208",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "Aye, that's right! Hehe... Sango dug up an all-new Onmyou technique for me and all!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720209"
            ]
          },
          "726720209": {
            "id": "726720209",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "I used that technique to modify this net once again, and I name this new model the \"Omni-Ubiquity Net\"!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720210"
            ]
          },
          "726720210": {
            "id": "726720210",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "According to Sango, this technique is able to detain the essence of living creatures before using certain objects as media to recreate the shape of that living being.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720211"
            ]
          },
          "726720211": {
            "id": "726720211",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "She even says that the utmost achievement of such an Onmyoudou technique is to recreate a human essence!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720212"
            ]
          },
          "726720212": {
            "id": "726720212",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "Such essences can answer questions and will never lie.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720213"
            ]
          },
          "726720213": {
            "id": "726720213",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "I must say that such a technique would be of unbelievable help to a detective like Sango!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720214"
            ]
          },
          "726720214": {
            "id": "726720214",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "You know what? I actually think that's why she told me about that technique and allowed me to make changes to the net...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720215"
            ]
          },
          "726720215": {
            "id": "726720215",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "Ah, ah! But don't you go around telling anyone that. I'm only telling you this because you and Sango are friends, alright?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720218"
            ]
          },
          "726720218": {
            "id": "726720218",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "Um, not yet...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720219"
            ]
          },
          "726720219": {
            "id": "726720219",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "No matter how I modify it, this net can only be used to recreate the essences of small creatures. It has no effect on humans whatsoever.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720220"
            ]
          },
          "726720220": {
            "id": "726720220",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "You know what, Traveler? Take this net with you. Who knows, seeing you in action might give me some inspiration again!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720221"
            ]
          },
          "726720221": {
            "id": "726720221",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "Here, take it with you — and remember, it's the Omni-Ubiquity Net now, not just the Ubiquity Net!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720222"
            ]
          },
          "726720222": {
            "id": "726720222",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "Go on, then, go catch a few lil' animals to test it out!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7267203",
      "subQuestName": "Use the Omni-Ubiquity Net to capture small animals",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7267204",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Wakamurasaki",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "726720401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "726720401": {
            "id": "726720401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "How did it go? Well?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720402"
            ]
          },
          "726720402": {
            "id": "726720402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It was a one-and-done...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720403"
            ]
          },
          "726720403": {
            "id": "726720403",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "Hmm... I suppose that was inevitable...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720404"
            ]
          },
          "726720404": {
            "id": "726720404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "Like I said before, this technique can detain the essence of a small animal, but if you want to retain that essence and recreate that animal, you will need a separate medium.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720405"
            ]
          },
          "726720405": {
            "id": "726720405",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "I integrated those techniques into the Net, such that it is also the essence-retention device and the recreation medium.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720406"
            ]
          },
          "726720406": {
            "id": "726720406",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That sounds... complicated...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720407"
            ]
          },
          "726720407": {
            "id": "726720407",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "Well, basically, each net can only be used once.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720408"
            ]
          },
          "726720408": {
            "id": "726720408",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "This is an issue that I haven't been able to solve yet, either. If the medium can't stand repeated use, the cost of this device will be way too high...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720409"
            ]
          },
          "726720409": {
            "id": "726720409",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "I'll continue doing research into this net and try to fix the problem as soon as possible.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720410"
            ]
          },
          "726720410": {
            "id": "726720410",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "If you still need Omni-Ubiquity Nets, you can come find me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720411"
            ]
          },
          "726720411": {
            "id": "726720411",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "And uh... even though these nets can catch small animals, they're a bit of a fuss to put together...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720412"
            ]
          },
          "726720412": {
            "id": "726720412",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "So, next time you want one of these nets, you'll have to pay me a nominal fee.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720413"
            ]
          },
          "726720413": {
            "id": "726720413",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Wakamurasaki",
            "text": "Relax! You're Sango's friend, I won't charge you too much. You'll get a good rate, I promise!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7267205",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Sango",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "726720501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "726720501": {
            "id": "726720501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Did you find Wakamurasaki?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720502"
            ]
          },
          "726720502": {
            "id": "726720502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, here's the deal with the Omni-Ubiquity Net...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720503"
            ]
          },
          "726720503": {
            "id": "726720503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "\"Omni-Ubiquity Net\"... You know what? It's not a bad name. Still, that technique...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720504"
            ]
          },
          "726720504": {
            "id": "726720504",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Can that technique really detain a human's essence?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720505"
            ]
          },
          "726720505": {
            "id": "726720505",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Uh, no. That's not possible.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720506"
            ]
          },
          "726720506": {
            "id": "726720506",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "There are only records of such an onmyoudou technique existing. Any practicum has long disappeared into the mists of time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720507"
            ]
          },
          "726720507": {
            "id": "726720507",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "The technique that I taught Wakamurasaki can only do that for small animals.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720508"
            ]
          },
          "726720508": {
            "id": "726720508",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Wait, then why didn't you tell her?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720509"
            ]
          },
          "726720509": {
            "id": "726720509",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Oh, that? I just wanted Wakamurasaki to help me spread a certain something around.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720510"
            ]
          },
          "726720510": {
            "id": "726720510",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "\"Bantan Sango Detective Agency's president is currently asking someone to create a net using Kamuna Onmyoudou that can make people tell the truth.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720511"
            ]
          },
          "726720511": {
            "id": "726720511",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "The long-lost Kamuna Onmyoudou, the Bantan Sango Detective Agency, and a net that can indeed detain the essences of small creatures.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720512"
            ]
          },
          "726720512": {
            "id": "726720512",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Put all three together, and you have an urban legend that both sounds impressive, and that actually has a grain of truth to it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720513"
            ]
          },
          "726720513": {
            "id": "726720513",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "For most people, these urban legends are just little stories... But for criminals who already have the seed of fear in their hands, such tales are not so simple.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720514"
            ]
          },
          "726720514": {
            "id": "726720514",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Ah, so that's how it is...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720515"
            ]
          },
          "726720515": {
            "id": "726720515",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "The other side of it is... Well, Wakamurasaki was starting to get on my nerves with that whole \"find me the strongest onmyoudou technique ever!\" nonsense.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720516"
            ]
          },
          "726720516": {
            "id": "726720516",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "I told her many, many times that such things don't exist, but she wouldn't listen! So I had no choice but to give her *something* to work with so she'd get off my back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720517"
            ]
          },
          "726720517": {
            "id": "726720517",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What if Wakamurasaki doesn't tell anyone about this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720518"
            ]
          },
          "726720518": {
            "id": "726720518",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Im-possible. She couldn't keep a secret to save her life. Trust me, I know her waaay too well...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720519"
            ]
          },
          "726720519": {
            "id": "726720519",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Either way, thanks for making the trip on my behalf. Take this. Consider it payment for the errand run.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726720520"
            ]
          },
          "726720520": {
            "id": "726720520",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Archon, I hope she doesn't come to bother me again. I'm a detective you know? Not some onmyouji..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7267251",
